From 8337a514bf4bc2b5a2bd94231cbdc13af854eb4a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bas Vermeulen <bas.vermeulen@blackstar.nl>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 13:35:36 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] video: logo: BlackstarEMS boot logo for the Luckfox Lyra PLC

Replace the 224-colour Linux logo with the BlackstarEMS brand mark and
wordmark (245x48 on black), shown by fbcon on the PLC's panel between
the first console output and the status panel service. Board-scoped in
the Armbian tree (board_luckfox-lyra-plc/), not part of the RK3506
series.

Signed-off-by: Bas Vermeulen <bas.vermeulen@blackstar.nl>

